# Keep the build context small. Do NOT add `.git`: the gitsha stage reads it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.output
**/.wxt
**/.angular
**/.adonisjs
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/tmp
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
docs/internal
# Native clients never enter the server image.
android
macos
